OL,3,GNEWSACare home closure warning after
OL,4,Ainspectors raise serious concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA care home in Renfrew has been warned
OL,7,Fit faces closure unless it addresses
OL,8,F"significant concerns" raised by
OL,9,Finspectors about the quality of care.
OL,11,FThe Care Inspectorate has told the
OL,12,Foperators they must make improvements
OL,13,Fby 15 December or risk having the
OL,14,Fhome's registration cancelled.
OL,16,FFailings included medication
OL,17,Fmanagement, monitoring residents'
OL,18,Fhealth needs, treatment of pressure
OL,19,Fsores and other wounds, management
OL,20,Foversight and nutritional care.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
